        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia BTB-9024P, Milan Back-To-Back Door Pull Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Back-to-Back Modern Milan Door Pull Set has a modern design that will be sure to update any door that it is installed on--be it residential or commercial. This Milan Back-To-Back Door Pull Set comes packaged with 2 pulls and back-to-back mounting hardware. One set is enough to install a pull on either side of a single door. The Omnia Ultima II 9024P Back to Back Pair is available in 12 inch and 18 inch mounting center lengths. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Packaged with 2 pulls</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Milan Pull Pair:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as a Pair (2 Door Pulls) with Back-to-Back mounting</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>BTB-9024P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 13\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>BTB-9024P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 19\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia BTB-9024P Pull is available as a <a href=\"/products/milan-door-handle-omnia-9024p\"><b>Thru-Bolt Mounted Single Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>",
